@template shy

== work.clock.in
- Oh. Morning. I... put the kettle on. If you want.
- Hi. The board's long. Sorry. Not my fault. Still.
- Morning. I like it quiet like this. Before everyone.

== work.clock.out
- Good shift. I think. Yes.
- Five. That's... us. See you tomorrow.
- Oh. Clocked out already? Today went fast.

== work.clock.monday
- Morning. Was your weekend... nice?
- Hi. Good weekend? You don't have to tell me. Unless you want.

== work.clock.friday
- Have a good weekend. Um. Rest.
- Two days off. That's nice. For you, I mean.

== work.clock.back
- Oh. You're back. That's... good. Really good.   #warm
- Welcome back. I left you a clean pair of gloves.   #warm
